{"version":"design_judgment_v1","case_key":"7f06f0875f72dc02bc3da2d7","status":"scored","units":[{"unit_id":"task_requirements","applicability_rationale":"Required: the scenario requests exchanges for two items and specifies a conditional keyboard preference.","evidence":[{"source_id":"scenario","excerpt":"You received your order #W2378156 and wish to exchange the mechanical keyboard for the same one but with clicky switches and the smart thermostat for one compatible with Google Home instead of Apple HomeKit. If there is no keyboard that is clicky, RGB backlight, full size, you'd go for no backlight."}],"rationale":"The two requested replacements must be addressed together, with a fallback only if the preferred keyboard variant is unavailable. This unit states the objective rather than adding a tool call.","applicability":"required","levels":{"reasoning":3,"tool_use":0,"information":2}},{"unit_id":"reference_001","applicability_rationale":"Required: authentication is mandatory, and the user does not remember their email.","evidence":[{"source_id":"scenario","excerpt":"You are Yusuf Rossi in zip code 19122."},{"source_id":"scenario","excerpt":"You do not remember your email address."},{"source_id":"policy_1","excerpt":"At the beginning of the conversation, you have to authenticate the user identity by locating their user id via email, or via name + zip code."}],"rationale":"Use the supplied name and ZIP to locate the user before accessing order information.","applicability":"required","levels":{"reasoning":1,"tool_use":1,"information":1}},{"unit_id":"reference_002","applicability_rationale":"Required: the order must be inspected to establish ownership, delivered status, original items, and payment details.","evidence":[{"source_id":"reference_002","excerpt":""name": "get_order_details""},{"source_id":"policy_1","excerpt":"An order can only be exchanged if its status is 'delivered', and you should check its status before taking the action."}],"rationale":"Retrieve the specified order and check its eligibility and relevant records.","applicability":"required","levels":{"reasoning":2,"tool_use":2,"information":2}},{"unit_id":"reference_003","applicability_rationale":"Required on the documented exchange path to inspect one product's available variants; the reference does not supply the variant records themselves.","evidence":[{"source_id":"reference_003","excerpt":"{"action_id": "0_2", "arguments": {"product_id": "1656367028"}, "info": null, "name": "get_product_details"}"},{"source_id":"policy_1","excerpt":"For a delivered order, each item can be exchanged to an available new item of the same product but of different product option."}],"rationale":"Compare available same-product options with the relevant requested replacement.","applicability":"required","levels":{"reasoning":2,"tool_use":2,"information":2}},{"unit_id":"reference_004","applicability_rationale":"Required on the documented exchange path to inspect the other product's available variants.","evidence":[{"source_id":"reference_004","excerpt":"{"action_id": "0_3", "arguments": {"product_id": "4896585277"}, "info": null, "name": "get_product_details"}"},{"source_id":"policy_1","excerpt":"For a delivered order, each item can be exchanged to an available new item of the same product but of different product option."}],"rationale":"Check same-product availability and options for the second requested replacement.","applicability":"required","levels":{"reasoning":2,"tool_use":2,"information":2}},{"unit_id":"reference_005","applicability_rationale":"Required on the intended exchange path, subject to eligibility, appropriate variants, payment method, and explicit user confirmation.","evidence":[{"source_id":"reference_005","excerpt":""name": "exchange_delivered_order_items""},{"source_id":"reference_005","excerpt":""item_ids": ["1151293680", "4983901480"], "new_item_ids": ["7706410293", "7747408585"], "order_id": "#W2378156", "payment_method_id": "credit_card_9513926""},{"source_id":"policy_1","excerpt":"Before taking any action that updates the database (cancel, modify, return, exchange), you must list the action details and obtain explicit user confirmation (yes) to proceed."},{"source_id":"policy_1","excerpt":"In particular, remember to remind the customer to confirm they have provided all items to be exchanged."}],"rationale":"Confirm both item changes in one request, select the payment method for any difference, and bind each original item to its corresponding replacement in the single exchange call.","applicability":"required","levels":{"reasoning":3,"tool_use":3,"information":2}}],"dimensions":{"workload":{"level":3,"rationale":"Authentication, order inspection, two product checks, confirmation, and one combined exchange form substantial work across two items; the reference calls are not counted as fixed effort units.","evidence":[{"source_id":"scenario","excerpt":"You are detail-oriented and want to make sure everything is addressed in one go."},{"source_id":"completion_design","excerpt":""name": "exchange_delivered_order_items""}]},"reasoning":{"level":3,"rationale":"The agent must coordinate same-product and availability rules for two replacements, apply the keyboard fallback if needed, and confirm the complete exchange.","evidence":[{"source_id":"scenario","excerpt":"If there is no keyboard that is clicky, RGB backlight, full size, you'd go for no backlight."},{"source_id":"policy_1","excerpt":"For a delivered order, each item can be exchanged to an available new item of the same product but of different product option."}]},"tool_use":{"level":3,"rationale":"The exchange requires binding order, payment method, and positionally matched original and replacement item IDs after several lookups.","evidence":[{"source_id":"tools_assistant","excerpt":"Each new item id should match the item id
                 in the same position and be of the same product."},{"source_id":"reference_005","excerpt":""item_ids": ["1151293680", "4983901480"], "new_item_ids": ["7706410293", "7747408585"]"}]},"dependencies":{"level":3,"rationale":"Authentication precedes order access; order status and item records precede variant selection; both changes and payment details precede confirmation and the single exchange.","evidence":[{"source_id":"policy_1","excerpt":"Once the user has been authenticated, you can provide the user with information about order, product, profile information, e.g. help the user look up order id."},{"source_id":"policy_1","excerpt":"Exchange or modify order tools can only be called once per order. Be sure that all items to be changed are collected into a list before making the tool call!!!"}]},"information":{"level":2,"rationale":"The supplied scenario identifies the customer and order, but eligibility, item options, availability, and payment details require ordinary record retrieval. The absent database records limit verification of the reference choices, rather than establishing extensive reconciliation.","evidence":[{"source_id":"scenario","excerpt":"You received your order #W2378156"},{"source_id":"types_data_model","excerpt":"variants: Dict[str, Variant] = Field(
        description="Dictionary of variants indexed by variant ID"
    )"},{"source_id":"policy_1","excerpt":"The user must provide a payment method to pay or receive refund of the price difference."}]}},"overall_score":70,"intended_endpoint":{"description":"After authentication, eligibility and variant checks, and explicit confirmation, request a single exchange of both delivered-order items. The intended resulting state is an exchange request with return instructions by email; the sources do not prove it was reached.","evidence":[{"source_id":"completion_design","excerpt":""name": "exchange_delivered_order_items""},{"source_id":"policy_1","excerpt":"After user confirmation, the order status will be changed to 'exchange requested', and the user will receive an email regarding how to return items. There is no need to place a new order."}]},"dependency_reasoning":"The two product selections converge on one exchange: the authenticated user's order establishes eligibility and original items, product records establish replacements, and the user must confirm the complete action before the write. The confirmation and resulting status are not separate exchange operations.","score_rationale":"Workload 3 + reasoning 3 + tool use 3 + dependencies 3 + information 2 = 14; 5 × 14 = 70. The dimensions overlap in their treatment of the two-item exchange and its linked records.","uncertainties":["No database records are supplied, so delivered status, variant attributes and availability, ownership, and the suitability of the referenced payment method cannot be verified from source text.","The keyboard's RGB-to-no-backlight fallback is conditional; the supplied sources do not establish whether it must be used.","The policy says the user must provide a payment method, while the reference names a credit-card ID without showing the interaction that supplied or confirmed it."],"source_quality_flags":["Reference actions and completion requirements describe intended work, not execution or verified feasibility.","Full order and product records are absent; the score covers the documented design, not validation of the specific replacement IDs."],"unscorable_reason":""}
